<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR YOUR EVERYDAY</view
  ><view class="heading">吃过的饭，留下的日常。</view
  ><view class="muted">认真做的每顿饭，都是生活的小小成果。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><block wx:if="{{j}}"
    ><view class="stats"
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{j.user.mealsCompleted}}</view
        ><view class="caption">累计完成 / 餐</view></view
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{j.user.streak}}</view
        ><view class="caption">连续签到 / 天</view></view
      ><view class="stat"
        ><view class="stat-value">{{j.favorites.length}}</view
        ><view class="caption">收藏菜谱 / 道</view></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">给日常留个印记</view
      ><view class="week"
        ><view wx:for="{{j.user.week}}" wx:key="date" class="day"
          ><view class="day-dot {{item.signed ? 'signed' : ''}}"
            >{{item.signed ? '✓' : item.dayNumber}}</view
          >{{item.label}}</view
        ></view
      ><button
        class="button light"
        disabled="{{busy || j.user.signedToday}}"
        bindtap="checkin"
      >
        {{j.user.signedToday ? '今日已签到' : '免费签到，记下今天'}}
      </button></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">我的餐桌记录</view
      ><view wx:if="{{!j.history.length}}" class="empty"
        >还没有完成记录。做完今晚菜单后标记完成，日常就会留下痕迹。</view
      ><view
        wx:for="{{j.history}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="plan row"
        data-id="{{item.recipe_id}}"
        bindtap="recipe"
        ><image src="/assets/{{item.art}}.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
          class="plan-info"
          ><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view
          ><view class="caption"
            >{{item.date}} · {{item.servings}}人份 · 已完成</view
          ></view
        ><text class="link">›</text></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">想再做一次的味道</view
      ><view wx:if="{{!j.favorites.length}}" class="muted section"
        >在菜谱详情收藏，随时免费查看。</view
      ><view
        wx:for="{{j.favorites}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="plan row"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="recipe"
        ><image src="/assets/{{item.art}}.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
          class="plan-info"
          ><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view
          ><view class="caption">{{item.minutes}}分钟 · 收藏菜谱</view></view
        ><text class="link">›</text></view
      ></view
    >
    <view class="card sage"
      ><view class="title">把一周晚饭，<view>也安排得从容一点。</view></view
      ><view class="muted section"
        >周计划助手生成7天候选及合计用料。每日选餐、完整做法及采购清单免费。</view
      ><view class="notice"
        >{{j.user.entitlement.active ? '管理员授予的内部测试权益，不来自广告。'
        : '广告奖励用途未核实，观看入口关闭。内部体验需管理员授予。'}}</view
      ><button
        class="button outline"
        disabled="{{busy || !j.user.entitlement.active}}"
        bindtap="generate"
      >
        {{j.user.entitlement.active ? '生成7天候选安排' : '尚未开放领取'}}</button
      ><block wx:if="{{week}}"
        ><view class="section title">已保存的安排</view
        ><view wx:for="{{week.days}}" wx:key="date" class="ingredient row"
          ><text class="caption">{{item.date}}</text
          ><text>{{item.title}}</text></view
        ><view class="notice">{{week.note}}</view
        ><view class="section title">一周合计用料</view
        ><view wx:for="{{week.ingredients}}" wx:key="id" class="ingredient row"
          ><text>{{item.name}}</text
          ><text class="quantity"
            >{{item.amount}}<text class="caption"> {{item.unit}}</text></text
          ></view
        ></block
      ></view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{j.grants.length}}" class="card"
      ><view class="title">内部体验权益记录</view
      ><view wx:for="{{j.grants}}" wx:key="id" class="ingredient"
        ><view>周计划助手 · 管理员授予</view
        ><view class="caption">内部测试，不可兑换，非广告收入。</view></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">反馈与回复</view
      ><view wx:for="{{j.feedback}}" wx:key="id" class="ingredient"
        ><view>{{item.message}}</view
        ><view class="caption"
          >{{item.state === 'resolved' ? '已回复' : '待处理'}}</view
        ><view wx:if="{{item.reply}}" class="muted"
          >回复：{{item.reply}}</view
        ></view
      ><button class="button light" bindtap="feedback">
        提交反馈与建议
      </button></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="profile-link" bindtap="privacy">隐私与数据说明 →</view
      ><view class="profile-link" bindtap="capabilities">广告与奖励状态 →</view
      ><view class="profile-link" bindtap="removeAccount"
        >删除我的账户与记录 →</view
      ></view
    ></block
  ><view class="footer">晚饭有谱 · 好好吃饭，慢慢生活</view></view
>
